{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/329286-scion-character-sheets","id":329286,"title":"Scion Character Sheets?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-03T09:25:10-08:00","id":329286,"title":"Scion Character Sheets?","content":"So I'm in a game of Scion right now, and we have a few people for whom this is their first game of Scion and/or using the ST system, and they're running headlong into a couple issues trying to figure out calculations. Now, I've got a PDF of Hero from DTRPG, and I'm aware of a lot of the PDF sheets out there, including Mr. Gone's frankly titanic offerings. But I was wondering if anyone was aware of any sheets that automatically calculated some of the figures such as DV, soak, and movement. <br /> <br /> I've got it down, more or less, but it'd be handy for about half or more of the remaining players if there was something to make it a little easier on them.<br /> <br /> Thanks in advance!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-03T09:32:04-08:00","id":329298,"title":"","content":"I would like one of those too.....but to the best of my knowledge no one has made that type of sheet yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2295-coderr","name":"CodeRR","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2295_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-08T04:14:20-08:00","id":334112,"title":"","content":"Yea, I don't think anyone has made any sheets that auto calc those figures. I'm only just getting into how that works(as I've done a few sheets for another game system that does calcs in a pdf).<br /> <br /> If I get some time, I might see what I can do for Scion. Can't make any promises it'll be soon though, with the Holidays and such coming up.<br /> <br /> If you think about it, send me an email sometime and I'll add it to my to-do list...might be a bit of work, but it'll give an idea how hard it'd be to make ST system sheets do calculations. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-08T05:10:05-08:00","id":334134,"title":"","content":"Will do. I've tossed together an excel sheet that does it, but it's aesthetically kind of sparse and a proper Scion sheet would be great.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-08T08:25:21-08:00","id":334225,"title":"","content":"I might have to look some of the claculations...but we'll see what I can do.<br /> <br /> The bad thing is, in order to get it calculate things based off dot ratings, I have to go and tell it what the number value of each dot is...then the javascript has to to be set up in the fields to calc em. It's weird...<br /> <br /> If you want an example, here is one of the sheets I've done with calcs: <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/Misc/DoubleCross_CharacterSheet_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pd...nteractive.pdf</a><br /> <br /> But yea, we'll see what we can do with this. Not sure I'd want to update all the sheets to do this, but I don't mind trying a few out. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83